# examples/18_graph_network
# Files this case shares with the rest of the repository.
#
# Each line is:   <path from the repository root>   <where it lands in the case>
# scripts/setup_case.sh copies them in before the case's own files, so anything
# the case carries itself wins.  They are listed here rather than copied into
# the case so that one geometry serves the cases that share it.
#
#   config/geometry/slot_one_biofilm.dat                       one biofilm patch (3) on each wall
#   pipelines/.../expected/aom.gnn                             the trained AOM network, from stage B4

config/geometry/slot_one_biofilm.dat                                  input/geometry.dat
pipelines/B_offline_models/B4_graph_network/expected/aom.gnn          input/aom.gnn
